      "content": "it's not really like a migraine though... it wasn't a slow build up, it just exploded. i dont have blurry vision or anything, just this intense pounding and a bit of nausea. i have stuff for migraines at home like sum triptans, can i just take a couple of those and sleep it off? i really dont want to sit in an er waiting room for 6 hours if it's just a bad headache.",
